{"type":"message","id":"c05bf196","parentId":"1f0b6b67","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:39:06.964Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-06-04 07:38 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Upload the draft at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-072101/article/final.md to WordPress using your standard wp-publisher flow. The feature image is at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-072101/media/feature.jpg (if it exists and is >0 bytes, upload it as the featured image). The metadata (title, excerpt, slug, category) is in /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-072101/research/validated.json. Write the final published URL to /tmp/wp-result.txt and yield ONLY the word \"SUCCESS\"."}],"timestamp":1780558746951}}
